(7234289, 1118887, 60173, '<td valign="top">I want to say how yummy this looks, because I''m certain it tasted wonderful when you ate it, but there''s something off-putting about the contrast. It feels like you messed with the brightness/contrast in order to blow out the background, and in turn, gave the tomatoes an unappealing darkness? Also, the shadows are very dark. I would have diffused your light source more to create a softer shadow.</td>', 'I want to say how yummy this looks, because I''m certain it tasted wonderful when you ate it, but there''s something off-putting about the contrast. It feels like you messed with the brightness/contrast in order to blow out the background, and in turn, gave the tomatoes an unappealing darkness? Also, the shadows are very dark. I would have diffused your light source more to create a softer shadow.', '2014-06-28 16:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
