(7252790, 1119204, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> And the recipe for the fish is...... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I just put a few pats of butter on top of the salmon, seasoning: onion salt, salt, black pepper, dill. You have to soak the wood plank (submerge in water) for at least 20 minutes. Put it on the grill for about 20-25 minutes. add some lemon if desired. (The plank will burn on the bottom- that''s ok)</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: And the recipe for the fish is......  I just put a few pats of butter on top of the salmon, seasoning: onion salt, salt, black pepper, dill. You have to soak the wood plank (submerge in water) for at least 20 minutes. Put it on the grill for about 20-25 minutes. add some lemon if desired. (The plank will burn on the bottom- that''s ok)', '2014-08-19 05:33:40.000000', NULL, 0),
